  "body": "I am trying to update the implementation note for the definition of fontBoundingBoxAscent and fontBoundingBoxDescent. After a discussion with dbaron@ and jfkthame@, I wrote the following:\r\n\r\nThe Implementations of fontBoundingBoxAscent fontBoundingBoxDescent</code> are expected to be equivalent to that of \"sTypoAscender\" and \"sTypoDescender\" in OpenType Specification OS/2 table. If these are not available, implementations returns \"ascender\" and \"descender\" in hhea table.\r\n\r\nref: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5429\r\n\r\nCould we confirm this is how is defined in CSS? \r\n\r\nThank you very much",
